%% Architecture trade-off triangles
graph LR
    classDef focus fill:#e8f2fb,stroke:#0a5387,stroke-width:2px,rx:18px,ry:18px,color:#0a5387
    classDef factor fill:#ffffff,stroke:#0a5387,stroke-width:2px,rx:16px,ry:16px,color:#0a5387

    A[Architecture Decision]:::focus --> P(Performance):::factor
    A --> C(Cost):::factor
    A --> M(Modularity):::factor
    A --> I(Integration):::factor
    A --> S(Standardisation):::factor
    A --> N(Innovation):::factor

    P -. trade-off .- C
    M -. tension .- I
    S -. balance .- N
